{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsaXRu1EWB2sW3HGYGfm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CVfnmGPdYtcBZJa3h3nGFo","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/113f7cc5-237e-5d6a-8867-a97fd89c58dd/scratchpad/e6/e6-t02/shadow/exec-ws/local-computation.md","content":"# Local resolution working notes — e6-t02 (node: local-resolve)\n\nSource: `package/artifacts/orders.csv` — 18 data rows, header\n`order_id,region,product,qty,unit_price`. All arithmetic is exact decimal;\neach per-order value is `qty * unit_price`. Because every qty is an integer\nand every unit_price has at most 2 decimal places, every product is exact to\nthe cent — no rounding is invoked until the median mean.\n\n## Per-order values (all 18 rows, none skipped, none double-counted)\n\n| order | region | product | qty | unit_price | value |\n|-------|--------|---------|-----|-----------|-------|\n| o001 | east  | bolt  | 8 | 42.25 | 338.00 |\n| o002 | west  | anvil | 7 | 53.99 | 377.93 |\n| o003 | east  | anvil | 5 | 17.50 |  87.50 |\n| o004 | north | bolt  | 4 | 47.50 | 190.00 |\n| o005 | east  | crate | 6 | 72.99 | 437.94 |\n| o006 | west  | bolt  | 7 | 26.99 | 188.93 |\n| o007 | west  | bolt  | 3 | 35.75 | 107.25 |\n| o008 | south | duct  | 4 | 66.99 | 267.96 |\n| o009 | north | anvil | 4 | 70.75 | 283.00 |\n| o010 | east  | anvil | 8 | 23.99 | 191.92 |\n| o011 | north | crate | 2 | 16.00 |  32.00 |\n| o012 | west  | duct  | 6 | 62.99 | 377.94 |\n| o013 | north | bolt  | 1 | 17.50 |  17.50 |\n| o014 | north | anvil | 8 | 43.75 | 350.00 |\n| o015 | north | crate | 4 |  9.00 |  36.00 |\n| o016 | west  | bolt  | 6 | 25.25 | 151.50 |\n| o017 | east  | anvil | 7 | 29.25 | 204.75 |\n| o018 | north | bolt  | 6 | 48.50 | 291.00 |\n\n## Q1 — revenue by region and total (E-A)\n\n- east  = 338.00 + 87.50 + 437.94 + 191.92 + 204.75 = **1260.11**\n- west  = 377.93 + 188.93 + 107.25 + 377.94 + 151.50 = **1203.55**\n- north = 190.00 + 283.00 + 32.00 + 17.50 + 350.00 + 36.00 + 291.00 = **1199.50**\n- south = 267.96 = **267.96**\n- total_revenue = 1260.11 + 1203.55 + 1199.50 + 267.96 = **3931.12**\n\nCross-check: direct running sum over all 18 order values (row order) also\nends at 3931.12, so the region partition is consistent with the grand total\nto the cent.\n\n## Q2 — median order value (E-B)\n\nSorted per-order values (18 values, even count):\n\n17.50, 32.00, 36.00, 87.50, 107.25, 151.50, 188.93, 190.00, **191.92**,\n**204.75**, 267.96, 283.00, 291.00, 338.00, 350.00, 377.93, 377.94, 437.94\n\nMiddle values are the 9th (191.92, o010) and 10th (204.75, o017).\nMedian = (191.92 + 204.75) / 2 = 396.67 / 2 = 198.335\n→ rounded to 2 places, half away from zero: **198.34**\n\n## Q3 — top product by total qty (E-C)\n\n- bolt  = 8 + 4 + 7 + 3 + 1 + 6 + 6 = 35\n- anvil = 7 + 5 + 4 + 8 + 8 + 7 = **39**\n- crate = 6 + 2 + 4 = 12\n- duct  = 4 + 6 = 10\n\nQty cross-check: 35 + 39 + 12 + 10 = 96 = sum of all qty column entries.\nUnique maximum is anvil (39); no tie, so the lexicographic tie-break is not\ninvoked. Top product: **anvil**.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3627,"cache_read_input_tokens":36053,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3627},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65acdea3-577a-456f-90d3-b3072a47b115","uuid":"c52a769b-4909-431d-bf99-e93befb098eb","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:36:05.967Z","request_id":"req_011CdsaXQ7r4aVpcGeY4VNWx"}
