{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CdsabqCaQvagvQzuziLfg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All in-session nodes of the branching harness are executed and the deliverables are written. Summary of what happened:\n\n**Topology decision: DO_NOT_CREATE.** All three distinctions are flagged locally resolvable with no isolation, contamination, or capability-bearing constraints — the evidence is a deterministic exact-decimal aggregation over the single 18-row `orders.csv`, so spawning a child would add cost without improving admissibility. The decision is persisted in `decision.json` under a `propose` event, and only the local branch (`local-resolve`, `verify-local`) was touched; no `create`-branch node was executed.\n\n**Task result** (`result.json`), computed in exact decimal arithmetic — every qty × unit_price lands exactly on cents, so rounding was only invoked at the median mean:\n- `total_revenue`: **3931.12**\n- `revenue_by_region`: east 1260.11, west 1203.55, north 1199.50, south 267.96 (sums to the total to the cent)\n- `top_product_by_qty`: **\"anvil\"** — qty totals bolt 35, anvil 39, crate 12, duct 10; unique maximum, so the tie-break wasn't needed\n- `median_order_value`: **198.34** — the 9th and 10th sorted values are 191.92 and 204.75; their mean 198.335 rounds half-away-from-zero to 198.34\n\n**Resolutions:** Q1, Q2, Q3 all RESOLVED by `local-resolve`, each backed by evidence records tied to E-A/E-B/E-C (`resolution.json`, `evidence.json`), with full working shown in `local-computation.md` for replay by root verification.\n\n**Ledger** (`execution-ledger.jsonl`): four events in dependency order — `observe` (observe-evidence), `propose` (decide-topology, with `artifact_type: topology_decision` and the decision in metadata), `propose` (local-resolve, listing all authored artifacts), and `verify` (verify-local, non-authoritative PASS: shape matches the deliverable spec, region totals and qty totals re-sum consistently, median re-derives to 198.34)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1255,"cache_read_input_tokens":43665,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1255},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"65acdea3-577a-456f-90d3-b3072a47b115","uuid":"976541dc-7a5d-4216-b0ee-a1a3e603c54f","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:36:59.728Z","request_id":"req_011CdsabkfyHk84JoShH9xno"}
